Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.72,0:00:17.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这些人面前丢多少次脸？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in front of these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.35,0:00:18.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我的天。  -别这么做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, my God.   -Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.59,0:00:20.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是，呃……那是性感瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's, uh... That's Hot Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.45,0:00:22.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以这就是派对卡车？你找到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, this is the party truck, huh? You found it.
