Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.19,0:00:26.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这一季，我们的男主角更有名。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This season, our suitor is more well-known.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.46,0:00:29.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士们，准备好了吗？达里厄斯·贝克！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies, are you ready? Darius Beck!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.20,0:00:31.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天。你喜欢他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God. You like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.70,0:00:33.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去参加了旧石器时代生活方式静修。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I went on a paleolithic lifestyle retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.83,0:00:35.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而，呃，这个节目是我的王国。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, uh, this show is my kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.47,0:00:37.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《永恒》是我的主意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Everlasting" was my idea.
