Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.67,0:00:40.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我。  -我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I am.   -I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.21,0:00:41.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的两个老板正斗得你死我活。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My two bosses are at each other's throats.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.81,0:00:43.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}科尔曼·沃瑟曼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Coleman Wasserman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.31,0:00:45.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在是他负责。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He is the one in charge now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.18,0:00:48.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你给了我剧集主管的职位，又基本上把它夺走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You gave me the showrunner job and essentially took it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:49.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你背后捅了我一刀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you stabbed me in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.88,0:00:51.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你我联手，我们能做出\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Between you and me, we can make shows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.38,0:00:52.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真正有意义的节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that actually mean something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.52,0:00:54.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是我一生的挚爱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're the love of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.86,0:00:56.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在有孩子了。我现在有责任了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have a baby now. I'm responsible now.
