Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.19,0:00:59.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和危害儿童安全被捕。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and child endangerment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.60,0:01:07.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，我说“到这儿之前让我下车”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, what part about, "Let me out before we get here"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.80,0:01:09.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你哪部分没听懂？什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}did you have a hard time understanding? What?
