Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.41,0:01:16.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我不想。嘿，拜托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I didn't. Hey, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.78,0:01:18.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们运作着这个电视网的主舰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We run the mother ship of this network.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.51,0:01:20.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，你得认下这个身份。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm saying you got to own it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.15,0:01:21.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}插上你的旗子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stake your flag.
