Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:47.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，我以前是为奎因管这个节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I was running the show for Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.58,0:01:48.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在为科尔曼管。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm running it for Coleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.91,0:01:50.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}戈德堡，你在跟剧集主管上床。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Goldberg, you're sleeping with the showrunner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.38,0:01:51.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}认了吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Own it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.54,0:01:53.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.38,0:01:55.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}宝贝，这真是你用枪打的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Babe, did you actually shoot this with a gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.95,0:01:57.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好笑了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.62,0:01:59.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在跟一个参赛者上床。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're sleeping with a contestant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.75,0:02:01.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}顺便说一句，你会因此被踢出局，年轻女士。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you could get kicked off for this, by the way, young lady. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.42,0:02:03.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}毕竟你上一季整季都在跟男主角上床？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After you slept with the suitor all last season?
