Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.26,0:02:10.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得我得看看。让我看看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think I should. Let me see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.86,0:02:13.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在就交给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hand it to me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.34,0:02:18.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.81,0:02:21.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，正好穿过我的眼睛。真不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yep, right through my eye. That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.61,0:02:23.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。去吧。发型和化妆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Go. Hair and makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.44,0:02:24.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Skedaddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.81,0:02:27.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回头见，亲爱的。去吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See you later, sweetie. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.65,0:02:33.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是不对的，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is wrong, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.59,0:02:35.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是19岁的Ins无脑网红。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not a 19-year-old Instagram bimbo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.96,0:02:38.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是老板。这不是看起来那样……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am a boss. This is not what it...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.29,0:02:41.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.90,0:02:43.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真是美极了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are a vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.26,0:02:45.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你回来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.40,0:02:47.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁保你出来的？哦。杰里米。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who bailed you out? Oh. Jeremy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.77,0:02:50.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。他显然知道该讨好谁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. Well, he clearly knows where his bread is buttered.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.37,0:02:51.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}监狱怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How was jail?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.24,0:02:57.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，很难熬，真的很难熬。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, it was hard, really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.58,0:03:01.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很多醉鬼、废物……很多呕吐物。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A lot of drunks, losers... a lot of puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.98,0:03:04.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那些就是你这种人，切特，习惯吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Those are your people, Chet, so get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.52,0:03:09.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我只是想说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, I just wanted to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.29,0:03:10.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？你想道歉？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? You want to apologize?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.86,0:03:12.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求我原谅？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Beg for my forgiveness?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.36,0:03:15.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在我地毯上切腹？来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Commit hari-kari on my rug? Go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.30,0:03:17.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……我想说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I wanted to say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.53,0:03:19.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}警察来之前我说的那些话……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That everything I said before the cops came...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:21.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是……那是真话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was... That was the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.50,0:03:22.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除了“我偷了我的孩子”那件事之外？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, other than the whole "I stole my baby" thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:23.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。除了那件事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Other than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.80,0:03:25.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}脱掉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.47,0:03:26.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是认真的，奎因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I meant it, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.28,0:03:29.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是我一生的挚爱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're the love of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:30.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特，住手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.01,0:03:32.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在让自己难堪，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're embarrassing yourself, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.95,0:03:35.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你没注意到，我很忙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you haven't noticed, I'm busy.
