Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.98,0:03:39.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要堵住约翰·布斯，然后我要说服他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna corner John Booth, and I'm going to produce him
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.79,0:03:43.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我经营他的一个电视网。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}into letting me run one of his networks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.52,0:03:45.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎因电视。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.49,0:03:46.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托。约翰·布斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please. John Booth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.86,0:03:48.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么每个在其他行业赚到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why is it that everybody who makes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.53,0:03:50.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}十亿美元的人都\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a billion dollars in some other industry
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.36,0:03:51.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就觉得自己能管我们的行业了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}thinks they can run ours?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.43,0:03:52.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是个混蛋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's a douche.
