Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.01,0:04:02.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.92,0:04:10.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}脱掉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.55,0:04:13.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，美国。性感时刻到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, America. It's sexy time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.62,0:04:15.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是你亲身参与的机会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is your chance to be a part of the action
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.36,0:04:17.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在《永恒》节目里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}here on "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.39,0:04:20.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚，Darius 要把关系推进一步\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, tonight, Darius is gonna take things to the next level
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.59,0:04:23.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和一位由你们选出的幸运女士。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with one lucky lady who you get to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.90,0:04:25.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然，我们会统计你们的投票\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course, we'll be tabulating your votes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.37,0:04:26.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在整场节目期间实时统计。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as they come in throughout the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.77,0:04:28.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打电话、发短信、发推文，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Call, text, tweet,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.57,0:04:30.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用 Snapchat 也行，投出你们的票\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Snapchat, if you will, your votes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.70,0:04:33.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}选出本季第一次过夜约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for the first overnight date of the season.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.57,0:04:37.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}记住……美国，是时候让你们的声音被听见了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And remember... America, it's time for your voice to be heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.35,0:04:43.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢，这简直是垃圾。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, that's garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.48,0:04:45.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Jay，那是什么破玩意儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jay, what is that crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.39,0:04:47.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托。我要的是巴黎之花或更好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, come on. I wanted Perrier-Jouet or above.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.59,0:04:48.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这简直……卡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is... And that's a cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.36,0:04:52.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.76,0:04:54.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没想到你会在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't think you'd be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.43,0:04:55.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还挺喜欢这样住一起的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I kind of like this bunking together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.80,0:04:58.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你想让我换个地方工作……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you want me to find somewhere else to work...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.43,0:05:00.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.57,0:05:01.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢，没什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.70,0:05:03.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是什么？可不是没什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is this? Not nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.94,0:05:05.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天，Rachel。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Holy shit, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.87,0:05:08.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在哪找到的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where did you find this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.54,0:05:10.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在摄影车里找到的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I found that in the camera truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.61,0:05:12.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在摄影……Jeremy？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In the camera... Jeremy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.98,0:05:15.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这足够开除他了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's a fire-able offense right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.85,0:05:19.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能开除他，他活好，而且动作很快。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't fire him because he's good, and he's very fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.39,0:05:21.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们俩以前是不是有过……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you guys have a thing toge...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.79,0:05:24.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是在评判你，但这太疯……我是说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not judging you, but this is cr... I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.03,0:05:28.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说点开心的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On a happier note,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.00,0:05:30.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你需要一件礼服，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you're gonna need a ball gown,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.46,0:05:32.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚六点我们下班走人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and we're leaving work at 6:00 tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.03,0:05:34.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}影响力大奖。那是 Quinn 的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Impact Awards. That's Quinn's thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.87,0:05:36.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我们的事。票是给制作人的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's our thing. Tickets go to the showrunner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.07,0:05:39.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去不了。感觉怪怪的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't. It feels weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.84,0:05:41.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}更像是棒极了而且早该如此，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}More like great and overdue, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.11,0:05:42.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道还有谁会去吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you know who else is gonna be there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.51,0:05:43.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.78,0:05:45.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}整个电视圈，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The rest of television,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.58,0:05:48.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们职业生涯中想合作的所有人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}everyone we're ever gonna want to work with in our careers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.48,0:05:50.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是绝好的机会，Rach。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a great opportunity, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.75,0:05:51.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们抓住它吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.46,0:05:57.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎回到《永恒》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome back to "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.06,0:05:58.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}本季已经过半，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're at the midway point of the season,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.73,0:06:00.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只剩七位女士。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}only seven ladies left.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.56,0:06:05.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们缩小到了你们的两位人气王。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But we have narrowed it down to your two fan favorites.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.16,0:06:07.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然，Darius 会分别和她们喝一杯\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, of course, Darius will share a drink with each
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.07,0:06:10.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后选一位共度良宵。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and then choose one with whom he will spend the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:13.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们统计了你们数百万的投票，美国，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have tallied your millions of votes, America,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.74,0:06:15.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}获胜者是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and the winners are...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.65,0:06:20.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Yael 和 Dominique。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yael and Dominique.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.18,0:06:21.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-噢！  -天哪！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh!   -Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.75,0:06:27.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这太好了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:29.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.92,0:06:32.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噢，哇。啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, wow. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.46,0:06:34.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些人呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where are these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.80,0:06:37.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想干什么，Rachel？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you want, Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.70,0:06:39.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想把 Yael 和 Dominique\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're trying to sell Yael and Dominique
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.93,0:06:41.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}包装成人气王？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as the fan favorites?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.17,0:06:42.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，一切皆有可能\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, yeah, anything's possible
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.00,0:06:46.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我们根本没统计那些票。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}since we don't actually tally those votes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.04,0:06:48.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我甚至都不知道那电话号码通向哪里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I don't even really know where that phone number goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.84,0:06:50.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，但为什么是 Dominique？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, but, like, why Dominique?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.64,0:06:53.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样性感 Rachel 就能拿到过夜约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So Hot Rachel gets the overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.61,0:06:55.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我给 Darius 真正的选择，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, if I gave Darius an actual choice,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.68,0:06:57.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我就得不到我想要的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}then I wouldn't get what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.52,0:06:59.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，顺便说一句，Darius 想要 Ruby。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, Darius wants Ruby, FYI.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.22,0:07:02.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他当然想。Madison！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course he does. Madison!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.09,0:07:05.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么在最后两人之前就搞过夜约会？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why are we doing overnights before the final two?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.26,0:07:06.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，因为我觉得节目需要\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, because I felt that the show needed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.93,0:07:08.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多点刺激……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a little more spice...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.56,0:07:11.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非你和 Coleman 有不同想法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}unless you and Coleman have a different idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.80,0:07:13.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许你想给我点意见？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe you want to give me some notes?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.80,0:07:17.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的造型师呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's my stylist?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.20,0:07:18.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.77,0:07:20.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}影响力大奖的票呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And where are the Impact tickets?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.24,0:07:22.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没有。那就去拿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't have them. Well, go get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.71,0:07:24.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我拿不到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.08,0:07:26.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Madison……不，事实上，她拿不到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Madison... No, actually, she can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.88,0:07:29.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.52,0:07:30.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为票在我这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because I have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.75,0:07:32.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看，票是给制作人的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See, they're for the showrunner,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.59,0:07:34.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而 Coleman 是制作人，所以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and Coleman's the showrunner, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.26,0:07:37.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.83,0:07:42.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-Quinn……  -出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Quinn...   -Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.00,0:07:52.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，完美。很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, that's perfect. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.54,0:07:55.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，Jeremy，有空吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Jeremy, you got a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.61,0:07:57.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有。有有有。什么事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Yeah, yeah, yeah. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.61,0:07:58.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伙计们，能给我们一分钟吗？当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Guys, could you give us a minute? Yeah, you bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.85,0:08:00.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我从电视网那边收到一些反馈\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, so, I got some feedback from the network
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.81,0:08:02.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于我们今年的风格，他们有些担忧。真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}about our look this year, and they have some concerns. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.82,0:08:04.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们怎么说？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, what did they say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.32,0:08:05.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们用了几个词\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, they used words
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.92,0:08:07.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比如“平淡”“缺乏动感”“没有进步”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}like "flat," "undynamic," "not evolving."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.02,0:08:10.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这到底是什么意思？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What does that even mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.09,0:08:12.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们有提到具体哪集或哪个场景吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did they mention specific episodes or scenes or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.29,0:08:14.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，没具体说。更像是整体性的讨论。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, nothing specific. More of a global discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.60,0:08:16.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总之，我要请一位视觉顾问\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyway, I'm gonna bring on a visual consultant
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.33,0:08:18.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来给部门调整一下方向。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to kind of course-correct the department.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.10,0:08:20.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}视觉顾问。嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A visual consultant. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.20,0:08:24.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这听起来……很像要换新的摄影指导。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That sounds... That sounds a lot like a new D.P.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.34,0:08:25.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要被炒了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Am I getting fired?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.67,0:08:27.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}绝对没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.68,0:08:29.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过与此同时，至少暂时，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In the meantime, though, for a little while at least,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.68,0:08:31.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要你先调去补拍组。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna have you move to the insert unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.21,0:08:33.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}补拍……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.25,0:08:34.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是从补拍组干起的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I started on the insert unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.25,0:08:38.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是瑞秋让你这么做的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel put you up to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.82,0:08:41.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我和瑞秋的关系不关你的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My relationship with Rachel is none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.79,0:08:44.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那也许我该辞职。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, maybe I should quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.12,0:08:46.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，你一直都有这个选择，不是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, well, you always have that option, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.00,0:08:52.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.07,0:08:55.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看起来很棒。嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You look great. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.70,0:08:56.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你确定要穿这条裙子吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, are you sure about this dress?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.67,0:08:57.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会不会太暴露了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not too revealing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.71,0:08:58.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得不会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.91,0:09:01.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，这是第一次过夜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, this is the first overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.24,0:09:04.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这真的很重要，而且……你的竞争对手……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a really big deal, and... your competition...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.38,0:09:06.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，对，我就是这个意思。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, yeah, that's kind of what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.25,0:09:07.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想让达瑞斯觉得我太刻意了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't Darius to think I'm trying too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.88,0:09:09.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，那你最好还是做点什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, you better try something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.85,0:09:11.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.22,0:09:12.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们投票给我了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They voted for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.72,0:09:14.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.29,0:09:15.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，今晚是关于达瑞斯的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, well, tonight's about Darius,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.89,0:09:17.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且说实话，他根本没注意到你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and, honestly, the guy hasn't noticed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.86,0:09:19.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？我是篮球运动员。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? I'm a basketball player.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.69,0:09:21.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我比所有人都高一英尺。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm a foot taller than everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.06,0:09:23.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管好坏，雅艾尔让自己被看见了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For better or for worse, Yael made herself known,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.30,0:09:25.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以如果你真想留下来……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so if you really want to stick around...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.26,0:09:27.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我该怎么做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.94,0:09:36.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}美国观众已经完成了艰难的选择\N{\rEN\blur0.8}America has done the difficult work
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.18,0:09:39.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把范围缩小到了雅艾尔和多米尼克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and narrowed the field down to Yael and Dominique.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.65,0:09:42.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，你怎么说，达瑞斯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what do you say, Darius?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.15,0:09:43.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢美国观众。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, America.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.72,0:09:45.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，显然，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, obviously,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.05,0:09:46.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最终决定当然由你来做，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the final decision is yours, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.95,0:09:50.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但为了帮你，我们让雅艾尔和多米尼克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but to help you, we have asked Yael and Dominique
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.09,0:09:52.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各自调制一款专属特调\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to come up with their very own specialty drink
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.03,0:09:54.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让你稍微感受一下，和这两位美女中的一位\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to give you a little insight on what an evening
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.76,0:09:56.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}共度一晚可能会是什么样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with each one of these beauties might have in store.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.33,0:09:58.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}应该是露比，你知道的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It should be Ruby, and you know it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.03,0:09:59.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上周那段，就像，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}after last's week's, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.43,0:10:01.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我拍到的美丽的努比亚式爱情盛宴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}beautiful, Nubian lovefest that I captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.77,0:10:04.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰……不。你带她来是出于错误的理由。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jay... No. You brought her here for the wrong reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.30,0:10:07.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，你以为她两集就会走，但猜怎么着？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rach, you thought she'd be gone in two episodes, but guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.04,0:10:09.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们之间发生的是真的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's happening between them is real,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.84,0:10:12.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而这本身就是个值得讲述的美丽故事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and that in itself is a beautiful story worth telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.24,0:10:14.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。也许最后会是她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. So maybe it'll be her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.18,0:10:15.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么会？你能别说了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How? Will you stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.45,0:10:17.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说真的，闭嘴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seriously, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.42,0:10:19.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有点信心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have some faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.32,0:10:22.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一点青柠汁，再加一丝橙花水，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A splash of lime juice, just a kiss of orange blossom,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.76,0:10:24.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三盎司金快活龙舌兰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}three ounces of Cuervo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.29,0:10:26.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是这个……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.13,0:10:27.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}加上覆盆子和薄荷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with raspberries and mint.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:30.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，她真是个性感尤物，不是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, she really is sex on a stick, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.36,0:10:32.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.03,0:10:34.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我叫它“未知深处”……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I call it an Uncharted Depth...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.17,0:10:35.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“未知深处”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uncharted Depth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.84,0:10:37.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一杯会随着时间慢慢展现自己的酒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A drink which reveals itself over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.90,0:10:38.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也是这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm that way, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.97,0:10:40.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}人们常常会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}People often get
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.77,0:10:42.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我的外表而产生误解，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the wrong impression 'cause of the way I look,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.11,0:10:43.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我从不和谁过夜，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I never spend the night with someone
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.41,0:10:44.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非我真的对那个人很认真。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}unless I'm truly serious about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.84,0:10:46.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“美国观众，欢迎来到我的胸部。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"America, welcome to my boobs."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.91,0:10:49.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多米尼克。我没给你准备花哨的鸡尾酒，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dominique. I don't have a fancy cocktail for you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.82,0:10:52.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我讲究的是诚实、正直，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because I'm all about honesty, integrity,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.05,0:10:53.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以及知道自己会得到什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and knowing what you're gonna get.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.75,0:10:56.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃！换句话说，床上无聊透顶。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh! In other words, a snoozefest in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.72,0:10:58.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她看起来像个魔术师。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She looks like a magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.26,0:11:01.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}简单一杯红酒……还有真相。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Simple glass of red wine... and the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.23,0:11:05.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你要和我们中的一个过夜，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you're gonna be spending the night with one of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.40,0:11:06.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那大概应该是那个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it should probably be the one
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.90,0:11:08.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没跟剧组人员上床的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who's not sleeping with the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.40,0:11:11.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？什么？等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? What? Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.27,0:11:12.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她刚才说什么？呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did she just say? Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.81,0:11:14.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.17,0:11:15.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你是说她在……  -达瑞斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Are you saying she...   -Darius.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.34,0:11:16.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你值得一个留在这里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You deserve someone who's here
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.84,0:11:17.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只为你的人，达瑞斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}just for you, Darius.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.01,0:11:19.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是为他而来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am here for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.28,0:11:20.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你表达的方式可真够奇怪的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got a funny way of showing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.95,0:11:22.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-别听她胡说。  -她当面骗了你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Don't listen to this.   -She lied to your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.32,0:11:23.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你在开玩笑吗？  -她一直在骗你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Are you kidding me?   -She's been lying to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.82,0:11:25.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-别闹了。  -你怎么敢……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Quit this.   -How do you get the nerve...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.32,0:11:31.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰瑞米，你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jeremy, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.89,0:11:33.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么，你喝醉了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What, are you drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.13,0:11:34.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Getting there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.76,0:11:35.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个混蛋把我降职了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This prick demoted me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.00,0:11:37.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我要正式投诉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so I'm filing a formal complaint.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:40.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不确定这符不符合规定流程。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not sure that's the protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.53,0:11:42.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会回插入组的，Chet。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not going back to insert unit, Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.97,0:11:45.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会从头再来。都五年了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not starting over. It's been five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.24,0:11:47.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想我有个办法，能帮到我们俩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think I have a way to help us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.11,0:11:48.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.88,0:11:50.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是跟台里谈过了，还是跟他谈过，还是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you talk to the network or talk to him or...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.91,0:11:52.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不不。别再走捷径了。跟我来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no. No more shortcuts. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.35,0:11:57.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是我说我不失望，那是骗人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd be lying if I said I wasn't disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.95,0:12:00.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Yael，我本来真的很期待\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yael, I was really looking forward
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.22,0:12:02.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚有机会多了解你一点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to getting a chance to know you a litt better tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.79,0:12:06.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但考虑到我刚知道的事……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But considering what I've just learned...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.39,0:12:08.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很确定我不会真心投入。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm pretty sure my heart wouldn't be in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.40,0:12:10.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能不能为自己辩解一句……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I just say, in my defense...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.43,0:12:12.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恐怕Darius的决定是最终的了，Yael。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm afraid Darius' decision is final, Yael.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.90,0:12:17.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Dominique，很抱歉，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dominique, I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.97,0:12:19.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但也不会是你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but it's not going to be you, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.54,0:12:21.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}虽然我看重专一和信任，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}While I value monogamy and trust,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.37,0:12:24.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也很欣赏谨慎和公平竞争，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm a big fan of discretion and fair play,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.24,0:12:26.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而这两样你今天都没做到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you showed neither of those today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.31,0:12:29.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}性感Rachel到底跟谁睡了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who the hell is Hot Rachel sleeping with?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.18,0:12:31.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}话虽如此，要是让梦幻套房\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That said, it would be a shame
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.95,0:12:33.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}空着也太可惜了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to let the dream suite go to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.92,0:12:37.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望美国观众不介意我选张外卡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hope America won't mind if I pick a wild card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.49,0:12:39.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我最讨厌他们擅自乱来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hate it when they go rogue.
