Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.25,0:17:32.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看起来效果相当不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and they seem to be working pretty damn well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.38,0:17:34.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，但这是过夜时段。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, but this is the overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.19,0:17:35.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在破坏规则。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're breaking the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.36,0:17:37.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实，那是我的规则。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually, those are my rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.29,0:17:39.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我定的，所以我想什么时候破就什么时候破。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I made them, so I can break them anytime I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.73,0:17:41.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.83,0:17:44.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}记录这段爱情故事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Capture this love story.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.70,0:17:47.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对吧？这是金子，Jay。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right? It's gold, Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.57,0:17:51.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你拍得很好，为什么要浪费？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You did some really nice work, so why waste it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.50,0:17:53.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我们永远用不了这些。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause we can never use any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.71,0:17:58.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，我们第一对黑人情侣相爱，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I mean, our first black couple falling in love,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.91,0:18:01.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}创造《永恒》的历史？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}making "Everlasting" history?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.35,0:18:03.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道，Quinn。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.92,0:18:06.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我……我是说，我答应过Ruby。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I... I mean, I promised Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.42,0:18:08.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她以为没人看着。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, she thinks no one's watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.22,0:18:09.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你上周好像没什么问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, you didn't seem to have a problem last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.86,0:18:12.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在她似乎可能走到最后，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And now it seems like she might go all the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.16,0:18:13.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你突然就怯场了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you're suddenly feeling skittish?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.73,0:18:14.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。那不一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. That was different.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.69,0:18:15.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.76,0:18:17.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.53,0:18:21.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想关就关掉摄像头吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can turn the cameras off if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.64,0:18:26.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是，别怪我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But, you know, don't blame me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.41,0:18:28.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等你还在管教那些厌食的傻妞\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when you're still wrangling anorexic bimbos
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.91,0:18:36.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.38,0:18:40.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 我会带你上去，去我们该在的地方 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* I'll take you up, up to where we belong *
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.55,0:18:42.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 别拦着我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Don't hold me back
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.39,0:18:45.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 得到最甜蜜的爱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Get the sweetest love
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.19,0:18:48.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 我会带你上去，去我们该在的地方 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* I'll take you up, up to where we belong *
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.66,0:18:50.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好。准备好了吗？  -完全好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Okay. You ready for this?   -Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.46,0:18:51.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。你认识这些人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait. Do you know all these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.93,0:18:53.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}认识一些。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Some of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.60,0:18:55.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那边戴时髦眼镜的一对……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The pair in the power glasses there...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.37,0:18:56.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们是HBO纪录片的主管。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're the head of HBO docs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.67,0:18:58.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我去介绍你认识。  -太好了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm gonna introduce you.   -I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.51,0:19:00.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}酒吧里那个中年尤物……是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Middle-aged hottie at the bar... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.21,0:19:01.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她管PBS的剧集。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She runs scripted at PBS.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.44,0:19:04.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有John Booth。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And there is John Booth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.84,0:19:07.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。刚买下我们电视台的人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, boy. The guy that just bought our network?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.65,0:19:09.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不不不。他不只是买了我们电视台。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no. He didn't just buy our network.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.68,0:19:11.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他大肆采购，买下整个帝国。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He went on a shopping spree, bought a whole empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.88,0:19:13.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们去向他推销点什么。你在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go sell him something. What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.92,0:19:15.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不能就这么向他推销。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We can't just sell him something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.56,0:19:16.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我们没什么可以……  -我们可以。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We don't have anything to...   -Yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.79,0:19:18.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这才对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.32,0:19:19.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们穿上华服，然后就去……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We put on fancy clothes, and we just go and...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.66,0:19:21.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后什么……满嘴谎话？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And what... Lie our ass off?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.33,0:19:22.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我本来想说推销。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was gonna say sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.90,0:19:24.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些人……他们不……他们不买节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These guys... they don't... They don't buy shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.73,0:19:26.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们买节目背后的人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They buy the people behind the shows,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.23,0:19:27.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我们在推销自己。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so we're selling ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.24,0:19:31.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.34,0:19:35.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}John Booth？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}John Booth?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.54,0:19:37.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Coleman Wasserman。我是《永恒》的节目统筹。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Coleman Wasserman. I'm the showrunner at "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.68,0:19:39.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我的制作搭档，Rachel Goldberg。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is my producing partner, Rachel Goldberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.35,0:19:40.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.38,0:19:42.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.48,0:19:44.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有个问题问你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I've got a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.52,0:19:47.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Beth Ann会走到最后吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is Beth Ann going all the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.32,0:19:48.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我最想看到的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause I'd like nothing more
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.72,0:19:50.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是看见这位阿拉巴马甜心小姐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}than to see Little Miss Sweet Home Alabama
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.66,0:19:51.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把黑人追求者带回家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}bring home a black suitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.96,0:19:54.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是《永恒》的头号粉丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm "Everlasting's" biggest fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.80,0:20:00.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里真该弄成个……汗蒸屋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This should really be a... a sweat lodge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.03,0:20:01.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我那静修营就是这么搞的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the way we did it at my retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:03.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底想干什么，Chet？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you trying to do here, Chet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.74,0:20:06.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}找出真相。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get to the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.41,0:20:07.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么真相？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.44,0:20:08.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}坐下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.28,0:20:14.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们总是……自欺欺人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We lie to ourselves... all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.98,0:20:17.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们是男人，所以很难开口求助，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're men, so we have trouble asking for help,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.78,0:20:21.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但今晚，我们要互相帮助。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but tonight, we're gonna help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.05,0:20:24.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会很难受，但我们会看清真相。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And it's gonna hurt, but we're gonna get clarity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.02,0:20:26.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你先来？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want to start?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.03,0:20:29.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，你……你……你先带头。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you... you... You lead it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.63,0:20:31.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你示范给我看怎么做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You show me how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.33,0:20:33.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.40,0:20:37.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Cynthia说得对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cynthia was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.70,0:20:40.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我偷走了我的孩子。是真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I stole my kid. I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.31,0:20:42.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是失误，也不是意外。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It wasn't a mistake. It wasn't an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.51,0:20:45.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我的错，我必须……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was my fault, and I got to...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.51,0:20:49.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我必须为自己的所作所为负责。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got to take responsibility for what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.65,0:20:52.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尤其是对Quinn。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Especially with Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.89,0:20:55.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，好沉重。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God, that's intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.49,0:20:59.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.96,0:21:06.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……我今天被降职了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh... I got demoted today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.50,0:21:10.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}被开除了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.54,0:21:12.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实我被开除了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got fired, actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.97,0:21:14.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}被电视台一个混蛋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}by a network douche bag
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.81,0:21:17.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}根本不知道我工作多有能力。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who has no idea how talented I am at my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.94,0:21:18.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。还有……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm. And...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.78,0:21:23.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是推卸责任。不是真相。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's blame. It's not the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.58,0:21:25.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说过这会很难受。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told you this was gonna hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.42,0:21:26.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再来一次。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Try it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.79,0:21:30.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}J.J.为《星球大战》做的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What J.J. is doing for "Star Wars,"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.69,0:21:31.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是我们为《永恒》做的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that's what we're doing for "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.02,0:21:34.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们在重建这个品牌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're rebuilding this franchise
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.36,0:21:35.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让它配得上自己的头条。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so it can live up to its own headlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.66,0:21:37.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们真的希望只是能有，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And we're really hoping just to have,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.06,0:21:39.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，高收视率，同时有点社会意义。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}um, huge ratings with some social relevance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.77,0:21:40.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第一步……黑人追求者。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The first step... Black suitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.00,0:21:42.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那全是Rachel的主意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was all Rachel's idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.03,0:21:43.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想让你觉得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want you to think
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.64,0:21:45.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是什么粗俗的收视率炒作。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that it was, like, some crass ratings grab.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.10,0:21:47.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不不不不不。它很有爆点，很应景。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no, no, no. It's explosive, timely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.51,0:21:48.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这种事很重要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This kind of stuff matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.94,0:21:51.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看，对我来说，电视圈就是一场圈地运动，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You see, to me, television is a land rush,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.58,0:21:53.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在找不怕\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I'm looking for pioneers who aren't afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.75,0:21:55.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走进荒野的开拓者，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to go out into the wilderness,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.11,0:21:56.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}圈下一块新地盘，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}stake a claim to a new piece of territory,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.95,0:21:58.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后把大众带进来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and then bring in the masses.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.82,0:22:02.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要找开拓者，干嘛跟他们谈？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you're looking for pioneers, why are you talking to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.02,0:22:08.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等他们进城的时候，妓院都装上智能马桶了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By the time they came to town, the whorehouse had a bidet,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.09,0:22:10.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}酒馆都用上嵌入式照明了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and the saloon had recessed lighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.53,0:22:11.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}John Booth，我是Quinn King。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}John Booth, Quinn King.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.96,0:22:13.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎呀，果然是真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, well, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.80,0:22:16.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你确实能镇住全场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You do fill a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.87,0:22:19.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，这两位是这么评价我的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, is that what these two have been saying about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.64,0:22:21.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，其实他们一次都没提过你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, actually, they haven't mentioned you once.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.67,0:22:23.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我做过功课。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I did my due diligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.18,0:22:26.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。我该担心吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm. Should I be worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.55,0:22:28.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恰恰相反。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On the contrary.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.45,0:22:29.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里所有人都知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everyone here knows
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.92,0:22:31.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你才是《永恒》真正的创作者，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that you're the true creator of "Everlasting,"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.72,0:22:35.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在一屋子传奇里，你也是传奇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and in a roomful of legends, you're a legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.16,0:22:43.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不敢相信她居然来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't believe she just showed up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.43,0:22:45.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.80,0:22:47.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们之前给他留下了好印象。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, we impressed him earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.17,0:22:48.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别前功尽弃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't undo all of that good work by...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.97,0:22:50.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真想拿龙虾叉戳她的眼睛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I literally want to stab her in the eyes with lobster forks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.00,0:22:52.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}做出那种事来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Doing something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.60,0:22:54.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放松点，喝一杯。来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just relax and have a drink. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.07,0:22:55.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打扰一下。这边。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.11,0:22:56.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}两杯香槟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Two champagnes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.68,0:22:59.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望我的水军没骚扰你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I hope my trolls didn't harass you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.78,0:23:01.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们不太出门。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They don't get out that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.18,0:23:03.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不容易被骚扰。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not easily harassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.48,0:23:05.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉我……是什么感觉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell me... what is it like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.45,0:23:07.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能买下任何你想要的东西？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to be able to buy anything you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.49,0:23:10.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，也不是……任何东西。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, not... anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.69,0:23:14.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，你看，这……很刺激。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, look, it's... it's exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.73,0:23:17.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它把恐惧这个概念整个拿走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It takes the whole concept of fear away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.56,0:23:20.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说真的，我真是这节目的铁杆粉丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I really am a true fan of the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.00,0:23:23.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在雪茄俱乐部为此被人笑话，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I get so much grief about it down at the cigar club,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.20,0:23:25.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但说实话，我一集都没落下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but honestly, I've never missed an episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.67,0:23:28.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。谁知道呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm. Who knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.07,0:23:30.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那告诉我。有什么……有什么秘诀？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, tell me. What's the... What's the secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.08,0:23:31.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么把那么多疯劲塞进一栋房子里？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How do you get that much crazy into one house?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.94,0:23:33.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.65,0:23:35.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，呃，抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, uh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.75,0:23:37.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，先别走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold that thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.05,0:23:38.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.68,0:23:40.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老鹰已着陆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The Eagle has landed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.05,0:23:42.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}重复……老鹰已着陆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I repeat... The Eagle has landed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.09,0:23:43.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，就是说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, that just means
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.66,0:23:45.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你让我办的事……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that the thing that you asked me to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.06,0:23:46.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在机场降落了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He landed at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.26,0:23:47.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，我知道了，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I got it, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.89,0:23:50.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马上带他去大宅。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just take him to the mansion right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.23,0:23:51.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，我会过去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, I will be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.86,0:23:54.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。我有个大胆的想法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. Here's a fearless idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.83,0:23:56.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想不想亲自来看看这疯狂的一切？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How would you like to come see the crazy for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.87,0:23:58.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.10,0:24:00.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。我加入。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. I-I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.11,0:24:01.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.94,0:24:06.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，我都没告诉家里人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I didn't even tell my family
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.88,0:24:09.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要退学来参加这个节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that I was dropping out of school and coming on this show.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.28,0:24:10.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开玩笑吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.78,0:24:12.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。我本来要说的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. I was going to.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.25,0:24:14.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我连要说的话都准备好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had my little speech planned and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.29,0:24:16.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但最后还是没胆说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I just chickened out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.66,0:24:18.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在他们肯定知道了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I'm sure they know now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.72,0:24:21.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.06,0:24:24.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来这个节目是为了表明立场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I came on this show to make a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.20,0:24:26.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从没想过会变成这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I never really expected any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.70,0:24:30.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你本身就是在表明立场，Ruby。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who you are makes a point, Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.77,0:24:34.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟着我爸去参加抗议\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have been going to protests
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.57,0:24:36.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从六岁就开始了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with my dad since I was 6 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.58,0:24:39.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小小个的Ruby举着小小的标语牌？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tiny, little Ruby with a tiny, little picket sign?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.88,0:24:41.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，但是说真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, but, like, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.15,0:24:42.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}豁牙子，举着黑人权力拳头，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Snaggletooth, Black Power fist,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.62,0:24:43.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}坐在他肩膀上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}up on his shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.82,0:24:47.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他算是我的英雄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's kind of like my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.62,0:24:48.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是不想让他失望。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just don't want to let him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.69,0:24:49.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我懂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.82,0:24:52.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的，我懂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do. I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.89,0:24:57.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，我每个周日上场打球，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, when I go out there every Sunday and play,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.13,0:24:59.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是为自己打。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not playing for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.06,0:25:02.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我为妈妈、为我表弟打，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm playing for my mom, my cousin,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.60,0:25:03.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为我供着上大学的侄女们打，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}my nieces I'm putting through college,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.94,0:25:05.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为现在跟着我干活的侄子打。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}my nephew I've got working for me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.80,0:25:07.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}压力很大。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's a lot of pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.67,0:25:09.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有时候我会想，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And sometimes I think,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.14,0:25:12.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“如果我不打橄榄球了会怎样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"What if I didn't play football anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.88,0:25:16.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是……要是打不了了呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, what if... What if I couldn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.15,0:25:18.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我就是一个普通人呢？”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What if I was just a normal guy?"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.95,0:25:20.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能跟你说实话吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I be totally honest with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.59,0:25:22.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最好如此。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You better.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.29,0:25:26.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会更喜欢那个人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I would like that guy even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.69,0:25:30.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.87,0:25:42.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 你的触碰\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Oh, your touch
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.07,0:25:46.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 让我完整\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* It makes me whole
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.05,0:25:50.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 我渴望你的吻\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* I crave your kiss
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.75,0:25:54.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 滋味如神赐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* It tastes divine
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.95,0:25:57.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 你送我 Rach，嘿，你绝对想不到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* You send me Rach, hey, you are never gonna believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.39,0:25:59.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Jay，快告诉我Ruby没退出、没闹出什么乱子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jay, please tell me that Ruby didn't back out and cause a total scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.79,0:26:01.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 尽在掌控 不不不，一切都好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Under control No, no, no. It's all cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.39,0:26:02.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好。她表现得棒极了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's good. She's doing amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.90,0:26:04.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}简直是黑人版的《恋恋笔记本》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's like "The Notebook" for black people.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.63,0:26:06.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？你怎么知道？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? How do you even know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.77,0:26:08.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为Quinn新装了四台摄像机\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because Quinn put four new cameras
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.97,0:26:10.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在追求者套房里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in the suitor's suite.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.20,0:26:11.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.40,0:26:13.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。一切正常。相信我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. It's all good. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.07,0:26:14.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像……他们之间的那种东西，Rach……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's like... The stuff between them, Rach...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.87,0:26:16.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}简直是奇迹。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's like a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.64,0:26:18.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然，不是说上床那部分。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not the sex stuff, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.08,0:26:19.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Jay，听……听我说，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jay, just lis... Listen to me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.01,0:26:21.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这跟性没关系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This has nothing to do with sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.18,0:26:22.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果Quinn在那里装了摄像机，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If Quinn put cameras in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.28,0:26:23.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她肯定在搞鬼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}she is up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.42,0:26:25.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。不，她根本没……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. No, she's not even...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.85,0:26:28.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肯定要出事了。去查清楚是什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Something is about to happen. Find out what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.12,0:26:30.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 让你掌控，让你掌控我 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* That you take control, that you take control of me *
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.39,0:26:31.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得走了。嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have to go. Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.92,0:26:33.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得走了。我真不是开玩笑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have to go. I'm not even kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.36,0:26:35.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-怎么了？  -我发……Jay刚打给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What happened?   -I sw... Jay just called me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.43,0:26:36.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别这样了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop doing that!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.00,0:26:39.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就别抄近路！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then stop taking shortcuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.06,0:26:40.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟你说过吧？这会很痛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did I tell you? This was gonna hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.70,0:26:42.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得下功夫。承认你自己的问题！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have to do the work. Own your failings!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.97,0:26:45.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你要我说什么？！  -说出你的伤！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-What do you want me to say?!   -Say your damage!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.24,0:26:48.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 让你掌控，让你掌控我 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* That you take control, that you take control of me *
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.07,0:26:49.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-Rachel！  -这就对了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Rachel!   -There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.81,0:26:51.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的伤就是Rachel。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My damage is Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.38,0:26:53.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是个……她是个黑洞。她是毒瘤。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's a... She's a black hole. She's a cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.28,0:26:55.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-那是谁的错？  -是我的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Whose fault is that?   -It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.05,0:26:56.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-为什么？  -因为我爱她！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Why?   -'Cause I loved her!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.45,0:26:59.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 突然间我明白\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Suddenly I see
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.28,0:27:00.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爱她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.75,0:27:03.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 让你掌控 清晰了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* That you take control Clarity.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.06,0:27:04.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 让你掌控我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* That you take control of me
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.32,0:27:06.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感觉不错吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Feels good, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.42,0:27:08.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感觉糟透了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It feels like shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.00,0:27:13.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}**\N{\rEN\blur0.8}**
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.03,0:27:14.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Ruby在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where is Ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.27,0:27:15.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在就要见我女儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to see my daughter right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.74,0:27:17.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我带你去找我老板……Quinn。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm taking you to my boss... Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.24,0:27:18.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Madison，你在哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Madison, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.00,0:27:20.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我现在不行，Jay。  -好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I can't right now, Jay.   -Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.91,0:27:22.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底在干什么？出事了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell are you doing? Is something going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.01,0:27:25.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊。欢迎来到内殿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah. Welcome to the inner sanctum.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.74,0:27:28.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。感觉像走进了你的大脑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm. Feels like I just stepped inside your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.18,0:27:29.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Quinn，这是封闭拍摄。你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, this is a closed set. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.85,0:27:33.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎呀呀，你好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, well, well, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.05,0:27:34.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，乖女孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.72,0:27:39.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Quinn，他来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, he's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.19,0:27:40.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。系好安全带吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm. Oh, buckle up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.43,0:27:42.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么，还有更精彩的？嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What, it gets better? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.26,0:27:44.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Carter医生，欢迎。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dr. Carter, welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.26,0:27:46.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不不不不。你不能在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no, no. You can't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.20,0:27:48.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我几周来一直在联系你们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have been trying to reach you people for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.80,0:27:50.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Ruby在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's Ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.97,0:27:52.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我女儿在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.37,0:27:56.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，这有点尴尬，不过……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, this is a little awkward, but, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.21,0:27:57.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.01,0:28:03.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.29,0:28:12.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们这些人到底在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell are you people doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.29,0:28:14.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是色情节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is pornography.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.76,0:28:16.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些我们绝对不会播。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're never gonna air any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.86,0:28:18.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，总有机会播。该死。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, there's always a chance. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.80,0:28:20.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这玩意儿怎么摘下来？  -我女儿在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-How do I get these things off?   -Where's my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.40,0:28:21.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在就告诉我，不然我报警。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell me now, or I call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.87,0:28:23.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，冷静点，Carter博士。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, calm down, Dr. Carter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.50,0:28:24.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我马上带你去见她，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll take you to her right away, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.00,0:28:26.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}稍等。给我们弄点喝的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sit tight. Make us some drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.87,0:28:29.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Madison，立刻在我办公室外架好摄像机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Madison, cameras up outside my office now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.18,0:28:31.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}立刻在Quinn办公室外架好摄像机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cameras up outside of Quinn's office right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.78,0:28:34.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.95,0:28:37.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这边走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.35,0:28:39.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rach。说真的，你就不能拦住他别进去？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rach. Honestly, you couldn't keep him out of there?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.15,0:28:40.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还没反应过来他就已经在这了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was already here before I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.45,0:28:43.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我哪知道……不。不不不不不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What was I... No. No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.19,0:28:45.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不不不不。  -嘿，伙计们，把摄像机放下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No, no, no, no.   -Hey, guys, cameras down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.39,0:28:47.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伙计们，摄像机放下。伙计们，放下摄像机！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Guys, let's keep those cameras down. Guys, cameras down!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.36,0:28:48.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-Carter先生，停下。停下。停下。  -说真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Mr. Carter, stop. Stop. Stop.   -Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.36,0:28:49.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请停下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.96,0:28:52.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-Ruby。哦。  -爸？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Ruby. Oh.   -Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.40,0:28:53.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.87,0:28:55.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求你了，我们离开这。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please, let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.30,0:28:57.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你爸？  -你来这干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Your dad?   -What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.54,0:28:59.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说真的？你在干什么？进去。进去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honestly? What are you doing? Get in there. Get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.07,0:29:00.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，别进去……别进去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, don't go in... Don't get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.87,0:29:02.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哪都别去。不不不。就待在那。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't go anywhere. No, no, no. Stay right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.44,0:29:04.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别进去。别。说真的。对，坐那。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't go in there. Don't. Seriously. Yeah, sit there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.21,0:29:05.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就是忍不住，是吧，Quinn？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't help yourself, can you, Quinn, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.48,0:29:06.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}叫保安下来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want security down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.98,0:29:08.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-把Ruby的爸爸弄出去。  -行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I want Ruby's dad out of here.   -Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.31,0:29:10.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以把这一切关掉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can shut this down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.12,0:29:13.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后做出一档悲伤无聊、NPR式的道德说教节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you can produce a sad, boring little NPR morality play.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.85,0:29:15.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者你可以让它成为一档绝佳的电视节目\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or you can let this be the great piece of television
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.86,0:29:17.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你知道它本来就是。  -你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-that you know that it is.   -What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.82,0:29:20.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道你想讲那个故事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know you want to tell that story.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.26,0:29:24.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是你的本性，Rachel，而这就是我们热爱做的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is who you are, Rachel, and this is what we love to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.10,0:29:25.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跟我走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.50,0:29:26.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Carter先生，请出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mr. Carter, step outside, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.60,0:29:28.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么能让他进来？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How could you let him in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.03,0:29:29.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁来想想办法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Somebody do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.97,0:29:31.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}必要的话我会把你背出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will carry you out of here on my back if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.34,0:29:33.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托。你知不知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please. Do you have any idea
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.27,0:29:35.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这对我们的基金会影响有多大？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of the impact this will have on our foundation?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.21,0:29:39.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，走吧。我们走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.18,0:29:41.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rachel，不行。不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, no. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.58,0:29:44.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rach，不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rach, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.08,0:29:47.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不不不不不。我说了把那台摄像机弄出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no, no, no. I said get that camera out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.12,0:29:48.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。出去。出去。把那台摄像机弄出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Get out. Get out. Get that camera out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.92,0:29:50.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会有1700万人看这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}17 million people will be watching this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.86,0:29:53.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}保持冷静。保持冷静，好吗？把他们弄出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep this cool. Keep it cool, okay? Get them out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.12,0:29:55.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你尽管说。把你希望女儿听到的话告诉她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You go ahead. Tell your daughter what you want her to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.20,0:30:07.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你那么努力……16岁就进了门萨，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've worked so hard... MENSA at 16,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.04,0:30:08.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}优等生荣誉学会……就为了这个？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Phi Beta Kappa... for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.51,0:30:10.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那些都没变。全都变了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}None of that's changed. It's all changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.28,0:30:12.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在别人一搜你，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whenever someone Googles you now,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.31,0:30:14.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第一个跳出来的就是这个节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the first thing that'll come up is this show.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.08,0:30:15.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸爸，我上这个节目是为了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Daddy, I came on this show to have
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.58,0:30:17.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我们想表达的东西一个更大的平台。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a wider platform for what we're trying to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.88,0:30:19.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你怎么会变成这样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then how did you end up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.52,0:30:21.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我恋爱了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I fell in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.26,0:30:24.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.99,0:30:26.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在真人秀里四周就爱上人了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Love after four weeks on a reality show?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.59,0:30:28.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底中了什么邪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.19,0:30:30.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是职业橄榄球运动员，Ruby。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's a pro football player, Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.53,0:30:32.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我一年赚四千万。  -爸，你根本不了解他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I make $40 million a year.   -Dad, you don't even know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.50,0:30:34.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该知道的我都知道。得了吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know all I need to know. Bitch, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.00,0:30:36.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸，你在让自己出丑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dad, you're making a fool of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.14,0:30:38.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，是他！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.04,0:30:41.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}处在那个位置，有那样的地位，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To be where he is, in his position,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.37,0:30:43.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}却不为他的人民多做点事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and not doing more for his people.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.54,0:30:45.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Carter博士……拜托，我们谈谈好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dr. Carter... Please, can we just talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.58,0:30:47.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等你离开这里，亲爱的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Once you leave here, sweetheart,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.21,0:30:48.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就会明白自己是怎么被蒙骗的，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you'll see how you were deluded, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.41,0:30:49.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.45,0:30:51.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我带你回家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm taking you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.38,0:30:52.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，你不会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.52,0:30:58.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起，爸爸，但我要留在这里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry, Dad, but I'm staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.47,0:31:09.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真为你感到羞耻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm so ashamed of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.12,0:31:34.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。真是一场好戏。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow. Hell of a show.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.99,0:31:36.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可真不客气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't mess around.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.20,0:31:37.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有时候只是运气好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sometimes you just get lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.00,0:31:40.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。我一个字都不信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm. I don't believe that for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.60,0:31:42.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得你跟我一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think you're just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.57,0:31:45.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}运气是我们自己造出来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We make our own luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.27,0:31:48.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直以为这都是写好的剧本或编出来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, I always thought this was scripted or made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.01,0:31:51.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我们不编。我们让它发生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, we don't make it up. We make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.01,0:31:53.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，敬灾难大师。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, to the master of disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.74,0:31:56.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊。嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.68,0:32:01.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，Jay，Madison，把姑娘们叫醒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, Jay, Madison, wake the girls up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.09,0:32:02.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要举行淘汰仪式。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're having an elimination ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.19,0:32:05.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Quinn，都快午夜了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, it's almost midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.42,0:32:07.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不管有多晚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't care how late it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.33,0:32:10.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是我看到谁眼睛耷拉或者胸部下垂，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And if I see one droopy eye or saggy tit,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.16,0:32:11.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就有人要被炒鱿鱼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}someone's getting fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.70,0:32:17.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不如出去见见那些女孩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't you go outside and meet the girls
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.10,0:32:18.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我这边把这个准备好？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}while I get this thing ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.70,0:32:21.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能见见贝丝·安吗？当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I meet Beth Ann? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.04,0:32:22.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她说不定还会对你说那个“N词”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She might even say the "N" word for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.57,0:32:24.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}片场就在拐角。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The set's right around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.32,0:32:35.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.35,0:32:36.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把她父亲请来了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You sent in her father?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.02,0:32:38.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，你还让摄像机跟着他拍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, and you sent in the camera after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.49,0:32:40.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你能不能承认\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But can you just admit
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.09,0:32:41.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这跟节目一点关系都没有？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that this has nothing to do with the show?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.63,0:32:43.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这全是因为你心里不痛快\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is all about you being upset
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.16,0:32:44.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你没被邀请去派对，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that you weren't invited to the party,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.63,0:32:46.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你把气撒在鲁比身上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and so you're taking it out on Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.20,0:32:47.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别自欺欺人了，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, don't kid yourself, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.70,0:32:49.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我永远都在派对名单上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am always invited to the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.47,0:32:51.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你去那里的唯一原因\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The only reason why you went
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.04,0:32:52.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是因为你在跟老板上床。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is because you're banging the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.47,0:32:54.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可是跟最厉害的人学的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I learned from the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.11,0:32:56.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为科尔曼是你离开这里的门票？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think Coleman's your ticket out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.04,0:32:57.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得了吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.68,0:32:59.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你比那个乳臭未干的小鬼强多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You could run circles around that snot-nosed little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.14,0:33:00.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只是太害怕，不敢去做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're just too scared to.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.58,0:33:02.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗？我不害怕。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know something? I am not scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.31,0:33:04.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我这辈子第一次，真正有了搭档。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For the first time in my life, I actually have a partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.58,0:33:06.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什……他不是你的搭档。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wha... He's not your partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.18,0:33:08.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是你的切特，懂吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's your Chet, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.35,0:33:10.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他会偷走你所有的点子，然后把功劳全揽走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's gonna steal all of your ideas and take the credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.39,0:33:12.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。科尔曼不是切特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nope. Coleman is not Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.49,0:33:14.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他就是，但你不是我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, he is, but you're not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.49,0:33:16.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你撑不过去的，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not gonna survive it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.56,0:33:18.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会马上又沦落到睡车里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're gonna be right back to sleeping in your car
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.13,0:33:19.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}早饭就吸感冒药。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and snorting cold medicine for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.46,0:33:22.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，让我给你描绘一幅完全不同的画面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, let me paint you a very different picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.40,0:33:24.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}三年后，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In three years,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.07,0:33:26.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会有自己的节目，还有一个爱我的男人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will have my own show and a man that loves me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.41,0:33:29.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是想保护你，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I am just trying to protect you, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.54,0:33:32.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}保护我什么？不让我过上你从没有过的美好生活吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}From what, the beautiful life that you never had?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.21,0:33:33.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用了，谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.34,0:33:34.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在利用你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's a user.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.71,0:33:38.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是……小心点，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just... be careful, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.27,0:33:56.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.40,0:34:00.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的很抱歉，我爸那样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am so sorry about my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.14,0:34:02.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，又不是第一次有女孩的爸爸撞见我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, not the first time a girl's dad walked in on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.47,0:34:06.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过，高中之后可能是第一次吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, first time since high school maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.85,0:34:15.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道他是你爸，好吧，可是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know he's your dad, okay, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.15,0:34:17.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他有时候挺混蛋的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He can be an ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.16,0:34:21.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，我想用的词不是这个，不过……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mnh. Not quite the word I was gonna use, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.73,0:34:23.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他说的那些话……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The things he said...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.63,0:34:25.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他只是又惊讶又生气，而且……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was just surprised and angry and...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.66,0:34:28.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，但他也没全说错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, but he wasn't wrong, not about all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.27,0:34:32.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这听起来可能很疯狂，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This might sound crazy to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.47,0:34:35.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我知道我生来就是要有所作为，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I know that I was put on this earth to make a difference,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.44,0:34:37.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要被人听见，而且……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to be heard, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.18,0:34:39.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是来爱上个蠢货橄榄球运动员的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And not to fall for a dumbass football player.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.64,0:34:40.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你不止于此。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But you're more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.75,0:34:41.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道，鲁比。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know, Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.75,0:34:42.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，可你说过……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, but you said...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.52,0:34:47.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你难道不想成为那样的人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, don't you want to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.62,0:34:50.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能做得更多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can do more.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.49,0:34:51.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以站出来发声。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You could speak up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.69,0:34:54.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可以教你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I could teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.23,0:34:57.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以成为我爸说你不是的那种人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can be everything my father says that you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.46,0:34:59.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道的，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.46,0:35:01.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.87,0:35:03.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.33,0:35:33.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士们，显然，呃……今晚很漫长。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies, obviously it's, uh... It's been a very long night.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.33,0:35:35.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但对你们其中一人来说，马上就要结束了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But for one of you, it is about to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.77,0:35:39.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你的蜡烛熄灭了，就该说再见了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If your candle is extinguished, it is time to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.30,0:35:43.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达里厄斯，在你开口之前……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darius, before you say anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.81,0:35:45.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要道歉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need to apologize
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.64,0:35:48.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为我犯下的肮脏恶心的错误。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for the dirty, disgusting mistakes I've made.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.68,0:35:52.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“错误”。听到了吗？还是复数。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Mistakes." You hear that? That's plural.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.82,0:35:54.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我做了有失身份的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I did something beneath me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.35,0:35:57.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雅埃尔，别说了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yael, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.89,0:35:59.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是来评判任何人的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not here to judge anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.59,0:36:02.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……其实，对，你……你就是来评判我们的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um... actually, yes, you... You are here to judge us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.76,0:36:04.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们都是人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are all human.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.66,0:36:06.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们都会犯错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We all make mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.66,0:36:08.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们能做的就是从中吸取教训。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The best we can do is learn from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.53,0:36:10.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你今晚安全了，雅埃尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're safe tonight, Yael.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.37,0:36:14.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.91,0:36:17.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多米妮克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dominique.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.88,0:36:20.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的吗？我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seriously? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.61,0:36:22.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是跟你说了实话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All I did was to tell you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.35,0:36:23.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好让你去拉别人下水。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So that you could bring somebody else down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.68,0:36:26.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托！这是在开玩笑吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on! Is this a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.25,0:36:27.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能这样做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.59,0:36:29.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，我有点厌倦了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I'm getting a little tired
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.92,0:36:31.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}被人告诉我能做什么不能做什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of being told what I can and can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.03,0:36:41.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一号机，跟着她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Camera A, follow her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.53,0:36:43.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。今晚真难熬，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow. Tough night, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.30,0:36:44.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还没说完。还有一个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not done. I got one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.90,0:36:47.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不按剧本来了，女士们。达里厄斯要临时变卦了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's going off book, ladies. Darius is calling an audible.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.64,0:36:50.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。不。不不不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. No. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.28,0:36:51.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.61,0:36:53.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不不不不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.41,0:36:56.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起，鲁比，但你爸说得对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry, Ruby, but your dad was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.82,0:36:59.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还有很多重要的事要做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've got a lot of important work ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.98,0:37:01.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求你别这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.59,0:37:04.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着。不管你觉得我能成为什么样的人……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look. Whoever it is you think I could be...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.92,0:37:06.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你该去找那个人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you should go be with that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.43,0:37:07.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.66,0:37:08.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Darius，我不是那个意思。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darius, that's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.03,0:37:11.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。也许我可以做得更多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Maybe I could do more.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.40,0:37:12.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是说你错了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not saying you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.40,0:37:13.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just saying
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.83,0:37:18.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得自己配不上你，也配不上你爸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't feel like I'm enough for you or your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.31,0:37:21.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不喜欢这种感觉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I don't like how that feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.94,0:37:24.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Darius，求你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darius, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.38,0:37:25.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那要付出的太多了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's gonna be too much work
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.94,0:37:28.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每天让你失望，Ruby。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}disappointing you every day, Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.59,0:37:44.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真不敢相信我竟然信了你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't believe I trusted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.33,0:37:45.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Jay，我已经尽力了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jay, I did everything I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.54,0:37:51.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士们，呃，今晚的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies, uh, that concludes
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.34,0:37:53.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}淘汰仪式到此结束。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}our elimination ceremony this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.41,0:37:56.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚安。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.78,0:38:04.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，你该看的都看到了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, did you, uh, see everything you needed to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.05,0:38:05.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.42,0:38:11.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.56,0:38:18.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你……想跟我回家吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You, uh... You want to come home with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.83,0:38:22.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，哪个家？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, which home?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.43,0:38:24.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不是有三四个家吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't you have three or four?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.10,0:38:26.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}六个。不，七个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Six. No, seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.47,0:38:27.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以选。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.84,0:38:33.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很想，但明天我有事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I would, but I have this thing tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.51,0:38:35.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这话说得可真够含糊的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that sounds incredibly vague.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.61,0:38:39.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爸去世了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My dad died.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.15,0:38:40.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明天葬礼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Funeral's tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.62,0:38:41.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还没买棺材。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I still need a coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.62,0:38:44.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Costco 关门晚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Costco's open late.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.99,0:38:47.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没多少人知道，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not many people know this,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.12,0:38:49.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但 Costco 卖棺材。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but Costco sells coffins.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.13,0:38:51.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们有完整的殡葬服务部门。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They have a full mortuary services department.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.53,0:38:53.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么会知道？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And how would you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.13,0:38:55.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是亿万富翁成为亿万富翁的秘诀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that's a billionaire becomes a billionaire.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.04,0:38:59.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我们就去 Costco。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, then to Costco it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.49,0:39:17.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想谈谈……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you want to talk about...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.86,0:39:20.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谈 Ruby？有什么好谈的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}About Ruby? What's to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.79,0:39:22.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，我觉得……嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I feel like... Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.69,0:39:24.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那段素材肯定会很精彩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The footage is probably gonna be amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.16,0:39:26.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们做节目就是这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's just how we make the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.43,0:39:27.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我们就是跟着故事走。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, we're just, like, following the stories. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.80,0:39:29.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是有点惊讶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I guess I'm just a little surprised
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.74,0:39:31.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你竟然让 Quinn 插在我们中间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you let Quinn get between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.44,0:39:33.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.10,0:39:34.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她没有插在我们中间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's not between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.10,0:39:35.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.51,0:39:39.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，今晚太漫长了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, it's been a long night.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.11,0:39:41.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想我现在就回家了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think I'm just gonna head home right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.45,0:39:44.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好啊。我要……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sounds great. I'm gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.88,0:39:46.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，我要去把裙子退了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I'm gonna return my dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.18,0:39:49.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你今晚真的很美。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You looked really beautiful tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.09,0:39:50.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.76,0:39:57.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晚安，Wasserman。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good night, Wasserman.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.20,0:39:58.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回头见，“Vassar”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See you, "Vassar."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.08,0:40:21.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在加班啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're working overtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.19,0:40:25.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，我只是……只是在换衣服。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I'm just, uh... I'm just changing my clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.79,0:40:27.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得谈谈，Rach。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We got to talk, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.53,0:40:28.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在真的不想说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I really don't feel like talking right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.99,0:40:31.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你为什么派你那个混蛋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why did you send your douche bag
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.50,0:40:34.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小跟班男朋友来给我降职？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}little lackey of a boyfriend to demote me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.90,0:40:37.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我老实说根本不知道你在说什么。放屁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I, like, honestly don't even know what you're talking about. Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.90,0:40:39.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老兄，你喝醉了，你现在就是个混蛋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dude, you're drunk, and you're being an ass right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.50,0:40:40.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是混蛋？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm being an ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.94,0:40:42.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我们还真是绝配，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I guess we're the perfect pair, then,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.77,0:40:46.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你是个自私、爱操纵人的小贱人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because you're a selfish, manipulative little bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.71,0:40:47.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不。不。  -Jeremy，你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No. No.   -Jeremy, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.95,0:40:49.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。不。你想降我的职？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. No. You want to demote me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.78,0:40:51.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你当着我的面说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You demote me to my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.62,0:40:53.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想开除我，就当着我的面开除。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want to fire me, you fire me to my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.22,0:40:57.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}钱、鸡巴、权力，对吧？对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Money, dick, power, right? Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.76,0:40:59.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道你需要什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.62,0:41:00.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不需要男朋友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't need a boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.86,0:41:02.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不需要男朋友，Rachel。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't need a boyfriend, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.63,0:41:04.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你需要的是个动物园管理员\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What you need is a zoo keeper
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.70,0:41:07.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你是个野生动物，一旦被放开……我就是个野……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'cause you're a wild animal who if is let go... I am a wild...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.04,0:41:14.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那不是男人该做的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's not what a man does.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.21,0:41:18.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想帮你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I tried to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.91,0:41:20.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你被开除了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.16,0:41:32.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.79,0:41:35.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事。我只是得换衣服。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. I just have to change my clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.93,0:41:41.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
